{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-1","title":"1 Chronicles 17:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Nathan first approving the purpose of David, to build God a house, 3 after by the word of God forbids him. 11 He promises him blessings and benefits in his seed. 16 David's prayer and thanksgiving.</p>\n<p>as David. 2Sa 7:1,2-17; 2Ch 6:7-9; Da 4:4,29,30 Nathan. 29:29; 2Sa 12:1,25; 1Ki 1:8,23,44 I dwell. 14:1; Jer 22:15; Hag 1:4,9 the ark. Ps 132:5; Ac 7:46 under curtains. 5; 15:1; 16:1; Ex 40:19-21; 2Sa 6:17; 2Ch 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-2","title":"1 Chronicles 17:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Do all. 22:7; 28:2; Jos 9:14; 1Sa 16:7; Ps 20:4; 1Co 13:9 for God. 1Sa 10:7; 2Sa 7:3; Zec 8:23; Lu 1:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-3","title":"1 Chronicles 17:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>word. Nu 12:6; 2Ki 20:1-5; Isa 30:21; Am 3:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-4","title":"1 Chronicles 17:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>tell. Isa 55:8,9; Ro 11:33,34 Thou shalt not. 22:7,8; 28:2,3; 2Sa 7:4,5; 1Ki 8:19; 2Ch 6:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-5","title":"1 Chronicles 17:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>dwelt. 2Sa 7:6; 1Ki 8:27; 2Ch 2:6; 6:18; Isa 66:1,2; Ac 7:44-50 gone. Heb. been. from tent to tent. Ex 40:2,3; 2Sa 6:17; 1Ki 8:4,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-6","title":"1 Chronicles 17:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>walked. Ex 33:14,14,15; 40:35-38; Le 26:11,12; Nu 10:33-36; De 23:14 2Co 6:16; Re 2:1 the judges. Jud 2:16-18; 1Sa 12:11; 2Sa 7:7 tribes. Ac 13:20 feed. 11:2; Ps 78:71,72; Jer 23:4; Eze 34:2; Mic 5:4; Mt 2:6; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-7","title":"1 Chronicles 17:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I took thee. Ex 3:1-10; 1Sa 16:11,12; 17:15; 2Sa 7:8; Ps 78:70,71; Am 7:14,15 Mt 4:18-22; Lu 5:10 from following. Heb. from after. ruler. 2Sa 6:21; Mt 2:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-8","title":"1 Chronicles 17:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>I have been. 2; Ge 28:15; 1Sa 18:14,28; 2Sa 7:9; 8:6,8,14; Ps 46:7,11 have cut off. 1Sa 26:10; 31:1-6; 2Sa 22:1,38-41; Ps 18:1; *title made thee. 17; 2Sa 8:13; Ezr 4:20; Ps 71:21; 75:7; 113:7,8; Lu 1:52</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-9","title":"1 Chronicles 17:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I will. Jer 31:3-12; Eze 34:13 plant. Ps 44:2; 92:13; Isa 61:3; Jer 24:6; 32:41 and shall be. Eze 28:4; 36:14,15; 37:25; Am 9:15; Re 21:4 the children. Ps 89:22; Eph 2:2,3; 5:6 waste. Isa 49:17; 60:18 as at the. Ex 1:13,14; 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-10","title":"1 Chronicles 17:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>And since. Jud 2:14-18; 3:8; 4:3; 6:3-6; 1Sa 13:5,6,19,20 Moreover. Ps 18:40-50; 21:8,9; 89:23; 110:1; 1Co 15:25 the Lord. Ex 1:21; 2Sa 7:11; Ps 127:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-11","title":"1 Chronicles 17:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>when thy. 29:15,28; Ac 13:36 go to be. Ge 15:15; De 31:16; 1Ki 1:21; 2:10; Ac 2:29 I will raise. 28:5; 2Sa 7:12,13; 12:24,25; 1Ki 8:20; Ps 132:11; Jer 23:5,6 Ro 1:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-12","title":"1 Chronicles 17:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>He shall. 22:9,10; 28:6-10; 1Ki 5:5; 2Ch 3:1-4:22; Ezr 5:11; Zec 6:12,13 Joh 2:19-21; Ac 7:47,48; Col 2:9 I will. Ps 89:4,29,36,37; Isa 9:7; Da 2:44; 1Co 15:25; Re 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-13","title":"1 Chronicles 17:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>I will be. 2Sa 7:14; Ps 89:26-28,29-37; Isa 55:3; Heb 1:5 my son. Ps 2:7,12; Lu 9:35; Joh 3:35 I will not. 2Sa 7:15,16; 1Ki 11:12,13,36 as I took. 12; 10:14; 1Sa 15:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-14","title":"1 Chronicles 17:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>in mine.In the parallel passage, it is \"thine house, and thy kingdom.\" Jehovah was Israel's king; and David and Solomon were merely his viceregents, as well as types of the Messiah.</p>\n<p>Ps 2:6; 72:17; 89:36; Lu 1:32,33; Heb 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-15","title":"1 Chronicles 17:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>According. 2Sa 7:17; Jer 23:28; Ac 20:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-16","title":"1 Chronicles 17:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>sat before. 2Sa 7:18; 2Ki 19:14 Who am I. Ge 32:10; Ps 144:3; Eph 3:8 what is. Jud 6:15; 1Sa 9:21 that thou hast. Ge 48:15,16; 1Sa 7:12; Ac 26:22; 2Co 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-17","title":"1 Chronicles 17:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>a small thing. 7,8; 2Sa 7:19; 12:8; 2Ki 3:18; Isa 49:6 thou hast. 11-15; Eph 3:20 hast regarded. 8; 1Ki 3:13; Ps 78:70-72; 89:19-37; Php 2:8-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-18","title":"1 Chronicles 17:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>the honour. 1Sa 2:30; 2Sa 7:20-24 thou knowest. 1Sa 16:7; Ps 139:1; Joh 21:17; Re 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-19","title":"1 Chronicles 17:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>thy servants. Isa 37:35; 42:1; 49:3,5,6; Da 9:17 according. Mt 11:26; Eph 1:9-11; 3:11 great things. Heb. greatness. 29:11,12; Ps 111:3,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-20","title":"1 Chronicles 17:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>none. Ex 15:11; 18:11; De 3:24; 33:26; Ps 86:8; 89:6,8; Isa 40:18,25 Jer 10:6,7; Eph 3:20 beside thee. De 4:35,39; 1Sa 2:2; Isa 43:10; 44:6; 45:5,22 according. Ps 44:1; 78:3,4; Isa 63:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-21","title":"1 Chronicles 17:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>what one. De 4:7,32-34; 33:26-29; Ps 147:20 redeem. Ex 3:7,8; 19:4-6; De 15:15; Ps 77:15; 107:2; 111:9; Isa 63:9 Tit 2:14 make thee. Ne 9:10; Isa 48:9; 63:12; Eze 20:9,10 greatness. De 4:34; Ps 65:5; 66:3-7; 114:3-8; Isa 64:3 by driving. De 7:1,2; Jos 10:42; 21:43-45; 24:11,12; Ps 44:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-22","title":"1 Chronicles 17:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>thy people. Ge 17:7; Ex 19:5,6; De 7:6-8; 26:18,19; 1Sa 12:22; Jer 31:31-34 Zec 13:9; Ro 9:4-6,25,26; 11:1,2-12; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-23","title":"1 Chronicles 17:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>let the thing. Ge 32:12; 2Sa 7:25-29; Ps 119:49; Jer 11:5; Lu 1:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-24","title":"1 Chronicles 17:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>that thy name. 2Ch 6:33; Ps 21:13; 72:19; Mt 6:9,13; Joh 12:28; 17:1; Php 2:11 1Pe 4:11 a God. Jer 31:1; Heb 8:10; 11:16; Re 21:3 and let. Ps 90:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-25","title":"1 Chronicles 17:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>told thy servant. Heb. revealed the ear of thy servant. 1Sa 9:15 that thou. 10 found. Ps 10:17; Eze 36:37; 1Jo 5:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-26","title":"1 Chronicles 17:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>thou art God. Ex 34:6,7; Tit 1:2; Heb 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-17-27","title":"1 Chronicles 17:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>let it please. or, it hath pleased. blessest. Ge 27:33; Ps 72:17; Ro 11:29; Eph 1:3</p>"}]}